{"unit_id":"Breeze136__dsh-kb-rag#card-zh","repo":"Breeze136/dsh-kb-rag","commit":"2ce4679db93c52eaeb0b903f0c774c56f5ca0708","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"kb-rag 是面向 DSH 桌面端的本地文献知识库插件。它注册十个知识库工具，并提供会话控制命令和浏览器侧来源卡片；引擎将 PDF、TXT、Markdown、DOCX 与 Zotero 附件切分、索引到本地 SQLite，再以关键词和向量混合检索返回带章节、页码、DOI 与引文信息的证据。主要功能包括批量入库、深度检索与引文问答、DOI 或 arXiv PDF 获取，以及可选 HTML 答案页。适合需要管理论文资料并追溯回答来源的研究者。无需模型 API Key；首次使用需准备 Python 依赖并下载本地模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["npm-package/lib/index.js:1485-1758","npm-package/lib/client.js:461-480","npm-package/kb_engine.py:2212-2310","npm-package/kb_engine.py:3216-3300","npm-package/kb_engine.py:3652-3701"]}
{"unit_id":"Breeze136__dsh-kb-rag#card-en","repo":"Breeze136/dsh-kb-rag","commit":"2ce4679db93c52eaeb0b903f0c774c56f5ca0708","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"kb-rag is a DSH desktop plugin for a local paper library. It ingests PDFs and Zotero attachments into SQLite, then returns cited passages through keyword and vector search. It supports evidence based answers, DOI or arXiv PDF lookup, and HTML reports. Python dependencies and local models are needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["npm-package/lib/index.js:1485-1758","npm-package/lib/client.js:461-480","npm-package/kb_engine.py:2212-2310","npm-package/kb_engine.py:3216-3300","npm-package/kb_engine.py:3652-3701"]}
